# #5837, F2' (a5e2e2ef, #5837 comment 6654962443): a forward chain's stamp carries every
# forwarder on it, up to k, each attributed under the empty token.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestReforwardOmitsIntermediateForwarder
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a re-forward's stamp carries only the first and the immediate forwarders, so at depth 3 L, an intermediate hop, is not attributed (F2' replaces F2)
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithReforward = TRUE, WithOrphanForward = TRUE, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, MaxWindows = 0

--- FIND
Carried(h) == 1..h
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: F2's stamp: the first and the immediate forwarder only.
Carried(h) == {1, h}
--- END
